WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:01.680
- This is what I find interesting,

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:04.420
so you were actually about to quit acting

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:06.400
right before you got
"Schitt's Creek," right?

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:11.400
- Yes, just before "Schitt's
Creek" things were quite bleak.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.600
My house had just burnt down,

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:19.600
I had like $3 in my bank
account, things were,

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.870
I hadn't worked in close to two years

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:26.590
and I had just blown my
very first screen test,

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:29.020
like blown it, blown
it, blown it, blown it.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:32.620
And I found myself crying
in the Pacific Ocean,

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:34.340
a very snotty cry.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.317
And the universe was like,
"Don't do this anymore!

00:00:36.317 --> 00:00:38.540
"This is not for you."

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:39.760
But then two days later,

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:42.173
I got the audition for "Schitt's Creek."

00:00:42.173 --> 00:00:45.490
(all applauding)
(audience cheering)

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:47.490
- I love that you tell this story though,

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:49.120
because a lot of people
wouldn't tell that.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:49.953
And I think it's really cool

00:00:49.953 --> 00:00:51.780
because I do have friends that are actors

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:52.790
and it's a very hard job.

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:54.080
It's either you're like really winning

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.180
or you're just like really gone.

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:57.210
And same thing in music,

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:59.800
but it's just really cool
that you're open about it,

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.140
'cause everybody goes
through those moments

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:02.560
where you're like, "Oh my gosh,

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:04.920
like, should I move on
or should I do this?"

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.420
And I love that you're open about it.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:07.740
I also love that you're hilarious

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:09.480
and in one of my favorite
shows of all time.

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:11.650
- Thanks, thanks, Kelly Clarkson.

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:12.553
- It's so great.

